  "integration_changes": [
    "Task-prefixed module imports and relocated resource paths in a flat directory.",
    "Active optimizers imported from existing src/HGA and src/baselines packages.",
    "Portable repository-relative default data, output and cache paths.",
    "MSTAR enables the HGA variants already listed in its original suite and implemented by its original worker.",
